  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Malawi - Approvisionnement en eau des districts</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malawi - District Water Supply</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at: a)  improving the water supply system in 30 district centres including a regional capital, 3 forestry stations and 3 national park centres; b)  providing new water supply systems in 4 district centres and 2 forestry stations; c)  improving the three regional water maintenance depot; d)  providing vehicles and plant for direct labour, design and construction of 28 of the schemes; e)  completing the conversion of metric system of existing water meters and purchase of additional meters; and f)  provision of technical assistance to the Water Department of the Ministry of Works and Supplies.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR"></narrative>
  </description>
